ed fields:
1. parent site name + exact map/address;
2. every meaningful room/spot/micro-site from all person/AOAY sweeps;
3. person(s) and event(s) per micro-site;
4. historic/current continuity;
5. current access/permission/hours;
6. inside-complex wayfinding where knowable;
7. exact uncertainty where not knowable;
8. AOAY chapter/scene where applicable;
9. what Mark specifically wanted to experience there (read, meditate, stand at historical point, stay overnight, etc.).
No A-site is considered final-route-guide-ready without this microguide closure.
